  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-requirements/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with the `name:` front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow`. The file has the H1 title `# Habeas requirements` and a two-sentence preamble. Its first section is `## Workflow`. That section is an ordered list of steps 1 to 7, each written as a numbered checkbox. The later sections (`## Writing chapters`, `## Choosing references`, `## What the review checks`, `## Gotchas`) all come after it, so no other section precedes the workflow. The preamble under the title is not a section, so it does not break the requirement. No violation matches were listed for this site.",
